  "notes": "Mint-green (#00c47a) brand on pale grey-blue page; app bar uses soft mint→sky-blue gradient with frosted icon buttons. Every food card uses the same generic fork-and-knife icon on a mint tile instead of photos. Detail panel embeds a faithful US FDA Nutrition Facts label (black 2px border, thick rule bars, Helvetica) — deliberately contrasting the soft rounded UI. Gradient 'Add to Diary' (green→teal) primary button, Delete in red-tinted outline, Edit neutral. A floating circular teal robot button 'Open AI coach (hold to dictate food)' sits bottom-right above the tab bar. Selected list card gets a 2px green outline with mint fill. Bottom tab bar active item uses a wide mint pill. Three internal scrolling panels (sidebar, grid, detail)."
